    "k3-a21-p62-243": "Personal city report. Use location, population and notable places/features as in the source pattern.",
    "k3-a22-p62-385": "Formal email model: greeting, state that you want to visit Frankfurt, ask for museum/hotel information, thank the recipient, formal closing.",
